---
layout: page.njk
title: Registry
cloth: sky
intro: Having you there is the real gift. If you'd like to give something too, here's where to find us.
---
{%- if registries.length %}
<ul class="registries">
  {%- for r in registries %}
  <li><a href="{{ r.url }}"><span><strong>{{ r.name }}</strong>{% if r.note %}<br>{{ r.note }}{% endif %}</span><span>Open registry</span></a></li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ul>
{%- else %}
<div class="soon">
  <strong>Our registry is coming</strong>
  <p>We're still putting it together. Links will be here soon.</p>
</div>
{%- endif %}
